Authors, in order: Yuriy Romasevych, Viatcheslav Loveikin, and Dmytro Komarchuk.

Yuriy Romasevych, Viatcheslav Loveikin, and Dmytro Komarchuk hold the
copyright in *Metaheuristic Optimization with Python* (2026). The handbook
states that all rights are reserved and that reuse requires the publisher's
prior written permission, with the usual allowance for brief quotation.

This repository is a companion implementation of that handbook. On 19 October
2026, Dmytro Komarchuk, as a co-author and the last author listed above, gave
written approval to create this companion repository.

No open-source license (MIT, Apache-2.0, GPL, or otherwise) has been selected.
Approval to create the repository does not name one of those licenses. Until
the authors name a license, do not treat these files as licensed for
